# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 2 (each literal a whole number of nanoseconds), Type System ch. 2 (printed in its largest whole unit: 1.3ms is 1300us, 0.5us is 500ns, 90s stays 90s) and ch. 7 and 9 (a request goes out in the tick its event fires; the World's answer is that tick's input).
test a_wake_comes_back

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="go")
    1: Time.After
    2: Ui.Label(text="woke 0")
    3: Ui.Label(text="250ms 1300us 2min -2s 1h 7ns 500ns 90s")
  result: 0

tick 1
  in:
    0: click
  requested:
    1: Wake(after=1500ms, context="nap")

tick 2
  in:
    1: Wake(after=1500ms, context="nap")
  changed:
    2: Ui.Label(text="woke 1")
  result: 1
